@startuml
title Refund / Adjustment of Wallet Balance (Service-related Only)

|Student|
start
:Request refund/adjustment\nfor wallet/service transaction
(e.g. wrong canteen charge,\nparking fee error, leftover balance when leaving school);
:Submit request to Finance\n(online form or offline);

|Finance Staff|
:Receive refund/adjustment request;
:Log in to Finance module;
:Open "Refund / Adjustment" screen;

|Wallet System|
:Authenticate Finance Staff;
:Return access to refund functions;

|Finance Staff|
:Search for student and\nselect related wallet transaction(s)
(e.g. SERVICE_PAYMENT or TOPUP);
|Wallet System|
:Retrieve wallet and transactions\nfor that student;
:Display details to Finance Staff;

|Finance Staff|
:Review evidence & policy;
if (Approved for refund/adjustment?) then (yes)
  :Decide refund amount and type
  (partial/full; service refund or top-up correction);
else (no)
  :Reject request with reason;
endif

if (Request rejected?) then (yes)
  |Wallet System|
  :Record decision and reason\nin refund log;
  |Finance Staff|
  :Inform student (rejected);
  |Student|
  :See decision status;
  stop
else (no)
  |Finance Staff|
  :Enter approved refund amount\nand confirmation;
  |Wallet System|
  :Create REFUND/ADJUSTMENT transaction;
  :Decrease or increase wallet balance\naccording to finance decision
  (usually decrease balance if refund is\npaid out via bank/cash);
  :Update refund record status = "RESOLVED";
  :Return updated balance;
endif

|Finance Staff|
:Execute actual payment\noutside wallet (cash/bank transfer);
:Inform student that refund is completed;

|Student|
:See updated wallet balance\nand refund record in history;

stop
@enduml
